Western intelligence agencies led by the  Americans are now pretty much convinced  that the Ukrainian international  airlines plane was shot down by a  surface-to-air missile this video  emerged yesterday and it appears to show  the moment that the missile hit the  aircraft the missile is traveling from  the West  that's left to right on the screen as  you see it the aircraft is virtually  invisible in the night sky but it is  coming in the opposite direction on its  climb out of Tehran Airport just after  that moment of impact a ball of fire  possibly the aircraft spins off and  starts falling towards the ground we  know according to publicly available  data that flight PS 752 bound for Kiev  took off from Tehran Airport at 12  minutes past 6:00 in the morning local  time before leaving the airport's  airspace it made a slight turn to the  right possibly trying to return to the  runway it was flying at seven thousand  nine hundred and twenty-five feet at the  time and it was only a minute and a half  into its flight when it came down this  area here on Tehran's western suburbs is  the planes  area of impact the investigatory web  site Belling cat has worked out that the  mobile phone footage we saw was filmed  in the / and district it did that by  geo-locating the embedded data in the  video that's around three point three  kilometers from the impact area and once  Belen cat had that rough location they  could then use certain clues in the  video to build a clearer picture for  example the person who was filming was  facing to the northeast and that matches  the flight path of the aircraft they  were also able to match the building's  lampposts and other features in the  video with satellite images like these  of the area the investigators though  still have unanswered questions that  this video does not categorically clear  up very certain that this video shows an  explosion in the vicinity of the flight  path of this plane however I would not  say that this is proof that this plane  was shot down  there are still many further questions  about this event and clearly we'd like  more information before we can say  conclusively it was shot down European  intelligence sources have told us that  they're working on the theory that this  was an accident not deliberate because  of the 176 people on board the aircraft  82 were Iranian and so it just simply  wouldn't make sense really for Iran to  try and shoot it down and Tehran for its  part is adamant that it did not take  that action
 

